LaneOrchestrator is a clean-room implementation.

It acknowledges high-level design inspiration from my-codex, SkillMesh, and Sol Advisor.

This repository redistributes the VoltAgent Awesome Codex Subagents profile collection
from https://github.com/VoltAgent/awesome-codex-subagents at commit
5605c9c18b3687993919d6cc467af4a34898fee2. The 172 upstream TOML profiles are kept
under agents/voltagent-upstream/profiles with their MIT License. LaneOrchestrator adds only a
namespaced identity and its pinned Terra/High runtime fields when it installs them.
